 Ougonkyou - Papa to Issho", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Short focusing on Prushka included with the first volume of the <i>Made in Abyss: Retsujitsu no Ougonkyou</i> Blu-ray/DVD box set.", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2022, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#miabyss #メイドインアビス", "genres": ["Fantasy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Musical Theater", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Slapstick", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 153840, "title": {"romaji": "Midori no Makibao: Owaranai Chоusen!!", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Commemorating the 25th anniversary of the TV anime, a short episode that adapts the final chapter of the manga. Included with the <i>Midori no Makibao</i> Blu-ray box.", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2022, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#みどりのマキバオー", "genres": ["Comedy", "Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Animals", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 153906, "title": {"romaji": "Tekken: Bloodline", "english": "Tekken: Bloodline"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "\"Power is everything.\" Jin Kazama learned the family self-defense arts, Kazama-Style Traditional Martial Arts, from his mother at an early age. Even so, he was powerless when a monstrous evil suddenly appeared, destroying everything dear to him, changing his life forever. Angry at himself for being unable to stop it, Jin vowed revenge and sought absolute power to exact it. His quest will lead to the ultimate battle on a global stage — The King of Iron Fist Tournament. <br>\n<br>\n(Source: Netflix)", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 8}, "season"